@startuml SequenceDiagram_Home_Browse_Part2_APIs
' Part 2: Backend APIs for Home sections
!theme plain
title Home & Browse - Part 2: Catalog APIs (Movie / Customer)

skinparam maxMessageSize 100

participant "MovieRepository" as Repo
participant "WishlistRepository" as WishRepo
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "Movie Service" as MovieSvc
database "DB" as DB

== Trending ==
Repo -> GW : GET /movies/trending
GW -> MovieSvc : trending
MovieSvc -> DB : query
DB --> MovieSvc : list
MovieSvc --> GW : 200 movies
GW --> Repo : data

== Recommendations ==
Repo -> GW : GET /recommendations/:userId? limit=
GW -> MovieSvc : recommendations
MovieSvc -> DB : by user or trending fallback
DB --> MovieSvc : list
MovieSvc --> GW : 200
GW --> Repo : data

== Genres / Countries / Years ==
Repo -> GW : GET /movies/genres
GW -> MovieSvc : genres
MovieSvc --> GW : 200 list
Repo -> GW : GET /movies/countries
GW -> MovieSvc : countries
MovieSvc --> GW : 200 list
Repo -> GW : GET /movies/years
GW -> MovieSvc : years
MovieSvc --> GW : 200 list

== Wishlist ==
WishRepo -> GW : GET /user/:userId/watchlist
GW -> MovieSvc : watchlist (or Customer Service)
MovieSvc -> DB : watchlist items
DB --> MovieSvc : list
MovieSvc --> GW : 200
GW --> WishRepo : data

== Top new releases (Recently Watched) ==
Repo -> GW : GET /movies (latest) or topNewReleases
GW -> MovieSvc : latest
MovieSvc --> GW : 200 list
GW --> Repo : data

@enduml
